                            <comment id="17739591" author="JIRAUSER297438" created="Mon, 3 Jul 2023 11:39:32 +0000"  >&lt;h1&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;FixDesign&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Fix Design&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The current return body is&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
{&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;index_plan_id&quot;&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;9dd2239c-0cd12a7aeabd1f8b4d9c1675&quot;&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;decrease_layouts&quot;&lt;/span&gt;:0,&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;increase_layouts&quot;&lt;/span&gt;:3,&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;rollback_layouts&quot;&lt;/span&gt;:0} &lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;remove index_plan_id&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
decrease_layouts -&amp;gt; removed_layouts_size
increase_layouts -&amp;gt; added_layouts_size
rollback_layouts -&amp;gt; recovered_layouts_size &lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The existing API does not check the null value of the request parameter aggregation_groups, resulting in unclear error messages. Therefore, it is necessary to add a check for aggregation_groups.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
